  "title_original": "‘Obsession’ And ‘Backrooms’ Win Big at Fangoria Chainsaw Awards",
  "excerpt_original": "“Obsession” led this year’s Fangoria Chainsaw Awards with the most amount of wins, taking home five awards including Best Director for Curry Barker and Best Lead Performance for Inde Navarrette. Celebrating achievements in horror film, television and gaming, the fan-voted awards…",
  "published_at": "2026-10-26T02:30:00+00:00",
  "article_hash": "e91a3ade8a138eaa6205e0c134ff387e28453114d30e2e33499cb6627876a8fd",
