    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "“ Obsession ” led this year’s Fangoria Chainsaw Awards with the most amount of wins, taking home five awards including Best Director for Curry Barker and Best Lead Performance for Inde Navarrette.",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Obsession",
          "url": "https://variety.com/t/obsession/"
        },
        {
          "text": "Fangoria Chainsaw Awards",
          "url": "https://variety.com/t/fangoria-chainsaw-awards/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Celebrating achievements in horror film, television and gaming, the fan-voted awards premiered Sunday on Shudder and were hosted by Devon Sawa (“Final Destination,” “Chucky”). Among the night’s most stand-out moments were “Insidious” star Lin Shaye presenting the final award of the evening for “Obsession” and “Cujo” star Dee Wallace presenting the Goodest Boy award to the leading canine in “Good Boy,” Nova Scotia retriever Indy."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Related Stories"
    },
